**README.txt instructs safe multiplayer launch and Patch 1.1 installation.**

## Launch

`Launch Consolation.lnk` targets `JB_Launcher_s.exe -multiplayer`; edit path if non-default.

## Patch

Patch 1.1 may fail outside `C:\`; recommended default install, or manually copy files to game root.